  source: "dssat_ufga0701",
  conditions: "Gainesville FL, spring 2007; snap bean Bronco (Habit 1 determinate), high N, optimal irrigation, grown to dry seed (treatment 5); field, 34 plants/m2, rows 61 cm; planted 2007-03-15",
  x: Axis(variable: "days_since_sowing", unit: "d"),
  y: Axis(variable: "shoot_mass_g", unit: "g/plant"),
  basis: Some("Days after planting; planting date taken as sowing day 0. Field crop at stand density, so per-plant values are smaller than for a lone pot plant; compare shape and timing, not absolute size. Per-plant values = kg/ha / 10 / plants per m2."),
  method: "Measured time series, DSSAT UFGA0701 .BNT/.GBT file, column CWAD (all above-ground living dry mass); read from the file",
  gate: Info,
